  "description": "A generic persistence provider library for .NET that supports multiple storage backends (memory, file system, application data, and temporary storage). Features type-safe persistence with dependency injection support, async/await operations, and integration with ktsu.SerializationProvider and ktsu.FileSystemProvider libraries.",
